      "lineage": "Four package files reviewed; root MIT, no nested notice/override or attributed external code in this package. Module uses the historical gitlab.com/slon/shad-go path; this is retained as repository-lineage context. Allow only this package at this commit. Preserve MIT notice; author new deterministic public/full checks and implementation. Exclude testify, random workload, GC setting and benchmark.",
